WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.940
Speaker 1: Florida Governor Ron DeSantis war with&nbsp;
Disney World has now gone up yet another notch,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:10.440
with DeSantis threatening to build a&nbsp;
state prison right next to Disney World,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:15.660
which is hard to even say with a straight face&nbsp;
that this guy is so petty and so vindictive. But&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:23.340
he is. Let me remind you the back story here.&nbsp;
Disney faced internal pressure some time ago&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:31.740
to come out and criticize what is known as the&nbsp;
don't say gay bill in Florida. And the don't say&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:39.540
gay bill in Florida is this bill signed into law&nbsp;
which places restrictions on what can be taught in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:45.540
Florida classrooms about gender identity and about&nbsp;
sexual orientation as applied to kindergarten&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:51.840
through third grade. There was internal pressure&nbsp;
at Disney for them to come out and say, We are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:59.340
against this law. So Disney did that, and DeSantis&nbsp;
and Florida Republicans flipped out. They said&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.340 --> 00:01:06.000
that Disney is going woke and they subsequently&nbsp;
decided to punish Disney, including by taking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:14.580
control of that district, which basically operated&nbsp;
as a private municipal government by Disney. And&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:20.880
it contained Walt Disney World and some other&nbsp;
parks. And this has continued to grow and grow and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:27.960
grow. This is not really a battle I think DeSantis&nbsp;
can win, because even though I hate theme parks,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:31.980
I'm aware that tons of people love them and&nbsp;
tons of people love Disney and the movies,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:37.500
and Disney is generally very well-liked. And&nbsp;
so this is a risky thing for DeSantis to do.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:44.040
In addition now to saying that he is going to&nbsp;
start sending inspectors to look at the rides&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:49.680
at Walt Disney World, he now threw out the idea&nbsp;
during an event yesterday that maybe he will build&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:55.200
a prison next to Disneyworld, take that district.
